terParabolic.isReduced_iji_unconditional","kind":"theorem","line":360,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L360-L365","doc":"Cell faithfulness at every `M i j = 3` pair, unconditionally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_full","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_full","kind":"theorem","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L356-L358","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_injective","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L341-L354","doc":"**THE TITS RESIDUE, DISCHARGED IN FULL**: the simple map of every\nCoxeter system is injective. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:coxeter-geometric-representation","label":"prop:coxeter-geometric-representation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/coxeter-geometric-representation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.geomRepFull_simple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.geomRepFull_simple","kind":"theorem","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L337-L339","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.geomRepFull","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.geomRepFull","kind":"def","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L332-L335","doc":"The geometric representation of an arbitrary Coxeter system. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_isLiftable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_isLiftable","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L311-L328","doc":"**The Coxeter relations hold in the geometric representation of\nEVERY Coxeter matrix.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_pair_pow_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_pair_pow_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L164-L307","doc":"**`(fᵢfⱼ)^m = 1` at every bond order `m ≥ 3`.** The scalar pair is\n`m`-periodic at angle `φ = 2π/m`, and periodicity alone forces the\naccumulated root-coefficient sums to vanish. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.formLin_j_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.formLin_j_pair","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L87-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.formLin_i_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.formLin_i_pair","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L80-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_pair_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.reflEnd_pair_apply","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterGeometricRepresentationFull.lean#L68-L78","signatureChunk":0}]}